          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጻ የሚጠጣ የለም ። ⟪እስመ ይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 36,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብል ይኄይስ ሐዲስ እምነ ከ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 37,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ራሚ ፥⟫ ከመጻጻ አፍለኛው ይሻላ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 38,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ል ይላል ። እንደዚሁም ሁሉ ወ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 39,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንጌልን ሊማር ወዶ ሳለ ኦሪት",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 40,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ን የሚማር የለም ከኦሪት",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወንጌል ትበልጣለች ይላልና",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኦሪትን መጻጻ አላት አስቀድማ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተሠርታለችና ወንጌልን አፍለ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኛ አላት በኋላ ተሰርታለችና ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "section_title",
          "text": "ዘከመ ተናገረ ኢየሱስ በእን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "section_title",
          "text": "ተ ሰዊት ወዕለተ ሰንበት.።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "chapter_title",
          "text": "ምዕራፍ ። ፮",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": "፩",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወእምዝ ካዕበ ወፈረ እግዚእ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኢየሱስ ማዕከለ ገራውህ በሰ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንበት ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": "፩",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከዚህ በኋላ ጌታችን ኢየሱስ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ክርስቶስ በሰንበት በርሻ መካ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከል ሄደ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወመሐዉ አርዳኢሁ ሰዊተ ወ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሐሰዩ በእደዊሆሙ ወበልዑ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደቀ መዛሙርቱ እሸት እየቆ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ረጡ እያሹ ይበሉ ጀመር።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": "፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወይቤልዎሙ ፈሪሳውያን ለም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንትኑ ትገብሩ ዘኢይከውን ለ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ገቢር በሰንበት ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": "፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፈሪሳውያን በሰንበት ለመሥ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ራት የማይገባ ሥራ ለምን ትሰ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ራላችሁ አሏቸው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሐተታ ። ማቴዎስ ርኢ ዘይገብ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሩ አርዳኢከ ብለው ጠየቁት",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይላል ። ሉቃስ ለምንት ትገብ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሩ አሏቸው አለ ። እንደምን ነ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ው አይለያይም ቢሉ አይለያ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይም ። ነገር እንደ ማቴዎስ ነው",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ርኢ ዘይገብሩ አርዳኢከ ብለ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ው ጠይቀውታል ። ዝም አላቸ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ው ለምንት ትገብሩ ብለው እ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነሱን ጠይቀዋቸዋል ። የፊተኛ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውን ማቴዎስ የኋለኛውን ሉ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 35,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቃስ ጽፈዋል ። አንድም ነገር",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 36,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንደ ሉቃስ ነው ፡ ለምንት ት",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 37,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ገብሩ ብለው እነሱን ጠይቀዋ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 38,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቸዋል ። ዝም ቢሏቸው ባይመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        }
      ]
    }
